\begin{equation}
\frac{d\Sigma}{dt}
=
\mathcal{C}_{\text{inv}}
+
\mathcal{S}_{\text{stab}}
+
\mathcal{D}_{\text{prevent}},
\end{equation}
where each term represents a structural subsystem of the engine.

